                            <comment id="16454635" author="agoncharuk" created="Thu, 26 Apr 2018 18:04:29 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=ivan.glukos&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;ivan.glukos&quot;&gt;ivan.glukos&lt;/a&gt;, in the test you are trying to start two checkpoints, however the second checkpoint will be skipped (or may be skipped) because there are no modified pages after the first checkpoint. Please double-check the behavior.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16454642" author="agoncharuk" created="Thu, 26 Apr 2018 18:07:29 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;I think I got it, wakeupForCheckpoint may return early if there is an ongoing checkpoint. Looks good to me.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
